    {
      "text": "attribution: tester\nrelation: implies\nsource: węzeł się nie zsuwa\ntarget: lina nie jest mokra",
      "text_sha256": "d59e33c788bdd85c4ce08e7fcef926733775f3472c9e871e6d18de32d8ae9342",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 28,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 28
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: analyst\ntext: In my own test notes, “the beacon flashes” does not imply “the ferry waits”.",
      "text_sha256": "e46984e446274170979e8d34f3fbd807ab3f2d249d3bc4288eb7f51eefb3cc8d",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 33,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 33
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: analyst\ntext: In my own test notes, “the hatch is open” does not imply “the panel is lit”.",
      "text_sha256": "28c9fb50b974b9f6c7b2bfb5e6109be5f4a810b8f6dcc74689fb275ec182e456",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 31,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 31
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: analyst\ntext: In my own test notes, “the parcel is scanned” does not imply “the receipt is printed”.",
      "text_sha256": "b21b6fb536f1d42cc28e11bfb4abf45beea7a8c32d1fd41ba5170f883ac11931",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 34,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 34
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: analyst\ntext: W moich własnych notatkach „boja miga” nie implikuje „prom czeka”.",
      "text_sha256": "727ee8aee7765677a77991e20db606c3b1024cae7f5ad87f125c36742fc26eb6",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 28,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 28
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: analyst\ntext: W moich własnych notatkach „paczka jest zeskanowana” nie implikuje „drukuje się paragon”.",
      "text_sha256": "d29bfc0a9f57f27eb6ced0c0a8f3f0efc9b9b947ec8c99dd9b288e2ae7412584",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 32,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 32
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: analyst\ntext: W moich własnych notatkach „pokrywa jest otwarta” nie implikuje „panel się świeci”.",
      "text_sha256": "980ba75c493d62cc353dc854af7f9ca0883ad8570b3824295b8849f05c6b89cc",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 33,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 33
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: author\ntext: However, “the latch is released” does not imply “the lever is down”.",
      "text_sha256": "d2e220b12ea0ce74ef55c5e98cd358f4b1275913f0433e72dd3f62ab7550d50b",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 26,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 26
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: author\ntext: However, “the seal is broken” does not imply “the heater starts”.",
      "text_sha256": "db71184d125593be8363ae46695198d23a671b2b8b2a9423d0d68a5a5db2b782",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 26,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 26
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: author\ntext: However, “the sky is cloudless” does not imply “the lens is capped”.",
      "text_sha256": "d8543254a4921af7302db6af5094802ee79129646e017b1e5051d3202733949c",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 28,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 28
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: author\ntext: If the latch is released, the bolt is free.",
      "text_sha256": "9585e916d1d55d28e7d567f3fe7add9f15a1d753b672621bff296ef296704f33",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 19,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 19
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: author\ntext: If the seal is broken, the vessel loses pressure.",
      "text_sha256": "450ae73bf33a36f4e02c00b68f7a5ff50bcb14a6cd1d678bc82739f1495a9004",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 20,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 20
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: author\ntext: If the sky is cloudless, the camera uses a short exposure.",
      "text_sha256": "0aa0fc2ac8ba1f8962f0112268209ff35898faca7d6f57af0be0e790301a4070",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 22,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 22
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: author\ntext: Jeśli niebo jest bezchmurne, aparat używa krótkiej ekspozycji.",
      "text_sha256": "fd86e731151a4fa9019c4ac7f586135a20405351ccb7404c7edba779c43dc784",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 24,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 24
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: author\ntext: Jeśli uszczelnienie jest przerwane, naczynie traci ciśnienie.",
      "text_sha256": "d3a79b0b6f6b8d45a428d0d066f9c27fef15e3cd736da21c9a7b5c305f891bc1",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 24,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 24
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: author\ntext: Jeśli zatrzask jest zwolniony, rygiel jest wolny.",
      "text_sha256": "7c261249c1b29dcac63004c9c901703031d4d42a92aa64fafde6a2c1fe8fb63d",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 20,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 20
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: author\ntext: Natomiast „niebo jest bezchmurne” nie implikuje „obiektyw jest zasłonięty”.",
      "text_sha256": "ba6c6b52b41fd56ce02a9f7c89f305845008a86eb1fec877cc277d692cc4d247",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 31,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 31
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: author\ntext: Natomiast „uszczelnienie jest przerwane” nie implikuje „grzałka rusza”.",
      "text_sha256": "06e53de1c04eb4464b4c377239c4a34a3af75c92b354704df27526f959272b66",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 28,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 28
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: author\ntext: Natomiast „zatrzask jest zwolniony” nie implikuje „dźwignia jest opuszczona”.",
      "text_sha256": "17205d69f122737997a73c9a94a5fd5bacdf4069c70bba0a19006e63cb9b55cf",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 28,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 28
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: author\ntext: To restate the same rule in different words: whenever no clouds cover the sky, the shutter interval is brief.",
      "text_sha256": "ee253ccc56a78f747398f4416b7efa3c8d8b45f3d75ae008c8ece6ad2762bfdc",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 32,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 32
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: author\ntext: To restate the same rule in different words: whenever the catch no longer holds, the pin can move.",
      "text_sha256": "646c92a73a3dfb426016795216e76e97abe34a10322e27915ba77dcc5e549998",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 30,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 30
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: author\ntext: To restate the same rule in different words: whenever the closure is no longer intact, the container cannot hold its pressure.",
      "text_sha256": "b78f8a9eea70001d9426d480a4356985bc61734ffec8e95a5c68bfb891e95973",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 33,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 33
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: author\ntext: Tę samą regułę ujmę innymi słowami: zawsze gdy chmury nie zasłaniają nieba, czas otwarcia migawki jest krótki.",
      "text_sha256": "0d91555d12d77841018dad6a75591c86fe01b1a8bb0c74f85a614c1cf1e6812f",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 43,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 43
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: author\ntext: Tę samą regułę ujmę innymi słowami: zawsze gdy zamknięcie nie jest już szczelne, pojemnik nie utrzymuje ciśnienia.",
      "text_sha256": "ad47898b7165a164e3d6dd11e44741405f765b2545be402f353ce14332faeb13",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 40,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 40
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: author\ntext: Tę samą regułę ujmę innymi słowami: zawsze gdy zapadka już nie trzyma, trzpień może się przesuwać.",
      "text_sha256": "6b6481328f9a1a4cda561e468b575f11995d280f329158a2e24c88cd617c9c5e",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 39,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 39
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: owner\ntext: A blocked drain causes a wet floor.",
      "text_sha256": "a309ecaf77dd9847cf4b0875a23aa0ddfcb1d4e00c67ea0666c65250bb66ce6a",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 17,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 17
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: owner\ntext: A loose belt causes a stalled wheel.",
      "text_sha256": "5ef323e2419044937ad34a6e0dd4b4753d8458a40909c6b09d990b7b2c4f090f",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 18,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 18
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: owner\ntext: A power dip causes a controller reset.",
      "text_sha256": "e3de25c4e7bcf91db91808193771fa9f1bb1c464213638bc4c317316ca95406c",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 16,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 16
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: owner\ntext: Correction: “a blocked drain” does not cause “a wet floor”; it causes “a flooded sump” instead.",
      "text_sha256": "f4905b4529ff138de5eff19f3e380f370120573c7de37663463675c90f09fa69",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 36,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 36
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: owner\ntext: Correction: “a loose belt” does not cause “a stalled wheel”; it causes “a squeaking pulley” instead.",
      "text_sha256": "1b04bc97cb224c038bcf00520b20f82acea82ecc3b3b574374760e972cb26156",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 39,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 39
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: owner\ntext: Correction: “a power dip” does not cause “a controller reset”; it causes “a clock drift” instead.",
      "text_sha256": "6acad5d764eed5f9af893ee4a3fde2368bff4c2cacff32e027e25d1944ee2874",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 34,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 34
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: owner\ntext: Keep the initial statement in the record. This correction was not known when I wrote it.",
      "text_sha256": "1b7d184eb0a0b953cbd36abe6882f7fb9cdb4ee5f2f92a7e07e0193d772b4993",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 26,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 26
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: owner\ntext: Sprostowanie: „luźny pasek” nie powoduje „zatrzymane koło”; powoduje natomiast „piszczące koło pasowe”.",
      "text_sha256": "8cdc69b4b674c59489a9ba8b7edbcfbdb525cbfcbf03ef1eb70cf8765c8d6bbd",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 39,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 39
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: owner\ntext: Sprostowanie: „spadek napięcia” nie powoduje „reset sterownika”; powoduje natomiast „dryf zegara”.",
      "text_sha256": "f9084707498894fa4a62ed9e4997b1c180d061960a71c78b80d7baec7bcef1bd",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 32,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 32
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: owner\ntext: Sprostowanie: „zatkany odpływ” nie powoduje „mokra podłoga”; powoduje natomiast „zalana studzienka”.",
      "text_sha256": "8160b6313e3983662a7bcab8e64b273273cf015c22feb713aa6e9e1a08c39511",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 36,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 36
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: owner\ntext: Zachowaj pierwszy zapis w historii. Sprostowanie nie było znane w chwili jego napisania.",
      "text_sha256": "632b6e1ab8861f7b99445339ec7cceae4aa7459fb6011b5e03d9dd0e8a27d2ca",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 27,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 27
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: owner\ntext: „luźny pasek” powoduje „zatrzymane koło”.",
      "text_sha256": "ac706416d2ed8e57dda884526fecbfe0c08ab6c0483f55f7159c00a2bf8cf55d",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 22,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 22
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: owner\ntext: „spadek napięcia” powoduje „reset sterownika”.",
      "text_sha256": "51451d1a5cf93fc87f5fa9e0fda0ea2db1352d8520d1d90e316e59ceb7b25f99",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 20,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 20
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: owner\ntext: „zatkany odpływ” powoduje „mokra podłoga”.",
      "text_sha256": "8ae0506e0e91738ef3feae65097057a814cc712665da4e6a13445d237d8e4475",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 22,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 22
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: reporter\ntext: I am reporting Mira's words, not endorsing the conditional.",
      "text_sha256": "900a94f87b2018cdb3f0aa9c06f91c07588be6c500192178273001a4bec95f4e",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 24,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 24
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: reporter\ntext: I am reporting Owen's words, not endorsing the conditional.",
      "text_sha256": "d2bb50acd6e800c88cb7ba9b40d7c3188f9d41600da27c37614c142618d89e33",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 24,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 24
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: reporter\ntext: I am reporting Priya's words, not endorsing the conditional.",
      "text_sha256": "cfe5b3bb4e78d90408f8aa6e2cb9595b8425206550b8fa10299d36bcbbe37171",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 25,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 25
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: reporter\ntext: Iga powiedział: „Jeśli boja miga, prom czeka”.",
      "text_sha256": "e6db18d2b9c5325edab84d60082b09ade7842729d725c4c1b82cb192352d7b12",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 20,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 20
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: reporter\ntext: Mira powiedział: „Jeśli pokrywa jest otwarta, panel się świeci”.",
      "text_sha256": "5d6cd2fe4e1b2a0fd36b919d4c06f15a44330f1e2a28f3edd22e874dd225cc09",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 27,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 27
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: reporter\ntext: Mira said: “If the hatch is open, the panel is lit.”",
      "text_sha256": "7e0c90032eba14d1f79cf12460325bc8cb9ddf1ba5261bdf0b168300bb6dbdf5",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 23,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 23
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: reporter\ntext: Olek powiedział: „Jeśli paczka jest zeskanowana, drukuje się paragon”.",
      "text_sha256": "549653c950180cac61c884be1777ce336d8f29dc7a1c6c90cb02a3dd55af666c",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 27,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 27
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: reporter\ntext: Owen said: “If the parcel is scanned, the receipt is printed.”",
      "text_sha256": "958e1a4250f1e9e3d7d61ba6445551f3b07b335246975784df4c4849bcdd0cf8",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 26,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 26
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: reporter\ntext: Priya said: “If the beacon flashes, the ferry waits.”",
      "text_sha256": "4787a383186515066582b0b40cc2db0479ff7b3a3e6ac2fad9054052d6d6442c",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 26,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 26
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: reporter\ntext: Przytaczam słowa osoby Iga; sam nie przyjmuję tego warunku.",
      "text_sha256": "7e935420329a0c3699bdcf20688c527b0aa63b2817852965c575ccd5122e6382",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 25,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 25
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: reporter\ntext: Przytaczam słowa osoby Mira; sam nie przyjmuję tego warunku.",
      "text_sha256": "051ee7afbe7ee33d709d0ca8091c2470c28c72abf4d1ca0b0d1594dae5e95de8",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 25,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 25
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: reporter\ntext: Przytaczam słowa osoby Olek; sam nie przyjmuję tego warunku.",
      "text_sha256": "ac51155682fa95d5a046c5b2f317a46f5b0df734f1cb82d8b6ce4fa9aba33e53",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 26,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 26
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: tester\ntext: If the gate is not locked, the courier does not leave.",
      "text_sha256": "8637a7ca1e8937c0a544da4841de1207f310bf6583e6c40d349eb4cf988dfbc7",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 22,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 22
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: tester\ntext: If the rope is not wet, the knot does not slip.",
      "text_sha256": "ed8630c9f41c64c07665512a1a7f056e9273b5538189d3de342e432c94fdc728",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 22,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 22
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: tester\ntext: If the sensor reports no error, the record is not discarded.",
      "text_sha256": "c4fa97f570148fabbc99097a194112f98dc66bbcd4a8c5a39fd9958a2e5df260",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 22,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 22
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: tester\ntext: Jeśli brama nie jest zamknięta, kurier nie odchodzi.",
      "text_sha256": "9988e578529f3075e7598dd8d21e09556f931b98e1d82e65c4977944effe294d",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 22,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 22
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: tester\ntext: Jeśli czujnik nie zgłasza błędu, rekord nie jest odrzucany.",
      "text_sha256": "2b516a74bf922f0343f81899bf74f688e5de982cab7ed988402d1ade57c1f779",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 23,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 23
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: tester\ntext: Jeśli lina nie jest mokra, węzeł się nie zsuwa.",
      "text_sha256": "b630f6accface53e83dc2812e1d5054a31c9202e09454ae3cdcd57f5249f5704",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 24,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 24
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: tester\ntext: Stwierdzenie „kurier nie odchodzi” nie implikuje „brama nie jest zamknięta”.",
      "text_sha256": "49b89a4c7be24f1d7e35011b5b7a65ef2fbefdde61be849f879043a7c0613a9c",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 29,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 29
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: tester\ntext: Stwierdzenie „rekord nie jest odrzucany” nie implikuje „czujnik nie zgłasza błędu”.",
      "text_sha256": "48a8be73d2c60651c534eb39d8b78f747d01873b243b7a378b14b5bad382f1eb",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 32,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 32
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: tester\ntext: Stwierdzenie „węzeł się nie zsuwa” nie implikuje „lina nie jest mokra”.",
      "text_sha256": "4910147455c594e7db544847582533412caadd2cfc39a699effb377f7e0523b7",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 30,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 30
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: tester\ntext: Ta reguła nic nie mówi o tym, czy dzwonek dzwoni.",
      "text_sha256": "e81d5f11e979de30046ff2a26476a950fc60663f40a49a4fd69c191fa6245cff",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 25,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 25
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: tester\ntext: Ta reguła nic nie mówi o tym, czy hak się wygina.",
      "text_sha256": "77c492b0b12a737040fd42c6db5c1a4a0643801f125eef8d3e95b9252d72658a",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 23,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 23
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: tester\ntext: Ta reguła nic nie mówi o tym, czy wentylator staje.",
      "text_sha256": "bb345181f628fe96854f6921348d31b80739d4fedf2b79937bed2e816cf1ef3d",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 23,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 23
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: tester\ntext: The statement “the courier does not leave” does not imply “the gate is not locked”.",
      "text_sha256": "76ae96f06391787a1fd8cabefcbee927a27b9a7ef3b74935540b0de3eeccc48a",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 29,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 29
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: tester\ntext: The statement “the knot does not slip” does not imply “the rope is not wet”.",
      "text_sha256": "ef0261f284ac0b0f717190d629692c8b86605044d7daaf2e61182c161b445d01",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 29,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 29
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: tester\ntext: The statement “the record is not discarded” does not imply “the sensor reports no error”.",
      "text_sha256": "864df9658ada57f09a7e7ac3f28e18006b040198d8c454da8addbe782200de79",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 29,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 29
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: tester\ntext: This rule says nothing about whether the bell rings.",
      "text_sha256": "0f9f0312205fbbba7c06804cc5fd15063ded206199848e7c2d01f34160d95694",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 18,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 18
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: tester\ntext: This rule says nothing about whether the fan stops.",
      "text_sha256": "669bb7256057a3e6dc180aca003cf14b84ff7b3d474c53b7e628eff49f0f7581",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 18,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 18
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "speaker: tester\ntext: This rule says nothing about whether the hook bends.",
      "text_sha256": "f22d30ed5b2d3f73d89f93e6620f80b30d8ca7f59503af9eda14ff3cf191eed9",
      "tokenization": {
        "encoded_tokens": 18,
        "truncated": false,
        "untruncated_tokens": 18
      }
    }
  ],
  "schema": "loom.research.graph_local_text_vector_index/1"
}
